s the book from the sculpture description, and uses the outlet name rather than the exact story title on first citation; (2) the Rubin encounter passage misreads the metaphorical quote "That combination stayed with me" as a claim that Rubin physically stayed on after his residency, and then mischaracterizes what struck him â€” substituting "Odeh's work oriented toward peace rather than animosity" for the source's actual dual observation of repeated vandalism alongside public invisibility. The frontmatter summary inherits both paragraph-one errors and carries a garbled trailing artifact; repair_editorial_surfaces will regenerate it from the corrected body. The structure, attribution consistency, date accuracy, and modality on the unsolved murder are all sound.ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;qvp-maPtZnFnQbtt418Fk8Kc79FK3ey5aOi4ZdDePAIƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkwsubmit_revision_requestƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;9NjZfim_DU9z63lITGFvRSsgXyZbQgq1fp892WzQvlIƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkgsuccessƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;zenwdScd-n9p5fYQg7xSPWJYknwcltfu6j4kPpm-UAoƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkicompletedƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;ymPVu8FUTC_cvfECKf9KsfFxpRu6SWScbBqVVXU9yGEƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkb55ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;b9TrAboPn892rHEKhjR4Bw_wsOdJ-zvRyMv5cIp6wzcƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarks0.30753939999999996ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;UENCa1yEvrEQGL0K7Av4Njzst3cMBvoc_efteckDT5Aƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark